abstract: >
  Core Rust, PyO3 Python, and R computational library supporting the 66-paper
  ECO-WIND benchmark and condition-based maintenance research program, funded
  by the European Union Erasmus+ CBHE project ECO-WIND (Grant No.
  ERASMUS-EDU-2025-CBHE-101177220) and designed for low-footprint execution
  (wheel size < 5 MiB, benchmark Peak RSS <= 150.0 MiB).
